          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}D&=(x^2-4)^{1/2}\\\\\\frac{dD}{dx}&=\\frac12(x^2-4)^{-1/2}(2x)\\\\&=\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{x^2-4}}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 23
